From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: built-in Picture Password pictures

Picture Password no longer needs a photo on the device. The setup's
first screen offers four built-in pictures next to Choose photo.

* SableBuiltInPictures draws each picture in code from a fixed seed: a
  dark gradient with 28 circles, squares and triangles in Sable colours.
  The same number always gives the same picture, so nothing is shipped
  as an image file and there is nothing to license.
* The chosen picture is saved as the Picture Password photo exactly like
  a picked photo (SablePicturePasswordStore.save with a Bitmap), so the
  bouncer is unchanged.
